  <p data-en="These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the BiasharaPOS application, website and related services (the “Service”). By creating an account or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms." data-sw="Masharti haya ya Huduma (“Masharti”) yanasimamia ufikiaji na matumizi yako ya programu ya BiasharaPOS, tovuti na huduma zinazohusiana (“Huduma”). Kwa kufungua akaunti au kutumia Huduma, unakubali kufungwa na Masharti haya.">These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the BiasharaPOS application, website and related services (the “Service”). By creating an account or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Eligibility &amp; accounts" data-sw="Ustahiki na akaunti">Eligibility &amp; accounts</h2>
  <p data-en="You must be a registered business or an authorised representative to use the Service. You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure and for all activity that occurs under your account." data-sw="Lazima uwe biashara iliyosajiliwa au mwakilishi aliyeidhinishwa kutumia Huduma. Una jukumu la kuweka salama taarifa za akaunti yako na kwa shughuli zote zinazofanyika chini ya akaunti yako.">You must be a registered business or an authorised representative to use the Service. You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure and for all activity that occurs under your account.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Pricing &amp; payment" data-sw="Bei na malipo">Pricing &amp; payment</h2>
  <p data-en="BiasharaPOS is free of charge for businesses processing up to 1,000 sales per month, with all features included. Above this limit, the Service is offered on a flat monthly subscription of TZS 200,000 with no per-transaction charges. Where fees apply, they are billed in advance and are non-refundable except where required by law. We will give you notice before any change to pricing takes effect. BiasharaPOS does not process your customers’ payments: money from a sale moves through your own account or terminal, and we record only the method and any reference you enter." data-sw="BiasharaPOS ni bure kwa biashara zinazofanya hadi mauzo 1,000 kwa mwezi, na vipengele vyote vimejumuishwa. Zaidi ya kikomo hiki, Huduma inatolewa kwa usajili wa mwezi wa TZS 200,000 bila gharama za kila muamala. Pale ada zinapotumika, hulipwa mapema na hazirudishwi isipokuwa pale sheria inapohitaji. Tutakupa taarifa kabla mabadiliko yoyote ya bei kuanza kutumika. BiasharaPOS haishughulikii malipo ya wateja wako: pesa za mauzo hupita kwenye akaunti au mashine yako mwenyewe, na sisi tunarekodi tu njia na kumbukumbu yoyote unayoingiza.">BiasharaPOS is free of charge for businesses processing up to 1,000 sales per month, with all features included. Above this limit, the Service is offered on a flat monthly subscription of TZS 200,000 with no per-transaction charges. Where fees apply, they are billed in advance and are non-refundable except where required by law. We will give you notice before any change to pricing takes effect. BiasharaPOS does not process your customers’ payments: money from a sale moves through your own account or terminal, and we record only the method and any reference you enter.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Acceptable use" data-sw="Matumizi yanayokubalika">Acceptable use</h2>
  <p data-en="You agree not to misuse the Service, including by attempting to access it through unauthorised means, reselling it without permission, or using it for unlawful activity. You are responsible for the accuracy of the sales and tax data you record." data-sw="Unakubali kutotumia vibaya Huduma, ikiwa ni pamoja na kujaribu kuifikia kwa njia zisizoidhinishwa, kuiuza tena bila ruhusa, au kuitumia kwa shughuli haramu. Una jukumu la usahihi wa data ya mauzo na kodi unayorekodi.">You agree not to misuse the Service, including by attempting to access it through unauthorised means, reselling it without permission, or using it for unlawful activity. You are responsible for the accuracy of the sales and tax data you record.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Your online shop and deliveries" data-sw="Duka lako la mtandaoni na usafirishaji">Your online shop and deliveries</h2>
  <p data-en="If you open an online shop, you are the seller. You are responsible for what you list and the prices you set, for having the stock you offer, for fulfilling or cancelling orders, and for anything your own riders do while delivering for you. We pass orders and messages between you and your customers; we are not a party to the sale." data-sw="Ukifungua duka la mtandaoni, wewe ndiye muuzaji. Una jukumu la unachoorodhesha na bei unazoweka, kuwa na stoki unayotangaza, kutimiza au kughairi oda, na kwa chochote madereva wako wanachofanya wakisafirisha kwa niaba yako. Sisi tunapitisha oda na ujumbe kati yako na wateja wako; sisi si upande wa mauzo.">If you open an online shop, you are the seller. You are responsible for what you list and the prices you set, for having the stock you offer, for fulfilling or cancelling orders, and for anything your own riders do while delivering for you. We pass orders and messages between you and your customers; we are not a party to the sale.</p>
  <p data-en="Your customers’ details belong to them and to you, not to us — we hold them on your behalf. You are responsible for handling them lawfully, including under Tanzania’s Personal Data Protection Act, and for answering your customers if they ask what you hold about them. Order messages are sent in your shop’s name, so keep them to what the order requires; the Service is not for marketing campaigns." data-sw="Taarifa za wateja wako ni zao na zako, si zetu — sisi tunazihifadhi kwa niaba yako. Una jukumu la kuzishughulikia kisheria, ikiwa ni pamoja na chini ya Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Data Binafsi ya Tanzania, na kuwajibu wateja wako wanapouliza unachohifadhi kuwahusu. Ujumbe wa oda hutumwa kwa jina la duka lako, hivyo uweke kwenye yale tu oda inayohitaji; Huduma si kwa kampeni za matangazo.">Your customers’ details belong to them and to you, not to us — we hold them on your behalf. You are responsible for handling them lawfully, including under Tanzania’s Personal Data Protection Act, and for answering your customers if they ask what you hold about them. Order messages are sent in your shop’s name, so keep them to what the order requires; the Service is not for marketing campaigns.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Tax compliance" data-sw="Ufuataji wa kodi">Tax compliance</h2>
  <p data-en="The Service helps you issue fiscal receipts built to the TRA VFD specification, but you remain responsible for meeting your own tax obligations under Tanzanian law. We are not a substitute for professional tax or accounting advice." data-sw="Huduma inakusaidia kutoa risiti za kodi zilizojengwa kwa maelekezo ya TRA VFD, lakini bado una jukumu la kutimiza wajibu wako wa kodi chini ya sheria ya Tanzania. Sisi si mbadala wa ushauri wa kitaalamu wa kodi au uhasibu.">The Service helps you issue fiscal receipts built to the TRA VFD specification, but you remain responsible for meeting your own tax obligations under Tanzanian law. We are not a substitute for professional tax or accounting advice.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Availability &amp; liability" data-sw="Upatikanaji na dhima">Availability &amp; liability</h2>
  <p data-en="We work to keep the Service reliable. Counter sales continue when your connection drops and sync when it returns; table service, the kitchen screen and online orders need a working connection. We provide the Service “as is” without warranties of uninterrupted availability. To the maximum extent permitted by law, BiasharaPOS is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from your use of the Service." data-sw="Tunafanya kazi kuweka Huduma ya kuaminika. Mauzo ya kaunta yanaendelea mtandao ukikatika na kujisawazisha ukirudi; huduma ya meza, skrini ya jikoni na oda za mtandaoni zinahitaji mtandao. Tunaitoa Huduma “kama ilivyo” bila dhamana ya upatikanaji usiokatizwa. Kwa kiwango cha juu kinachoruhusiwa na sheria, BiasharaPOS haina dhima kwa hasara zisizo za moja kwa moja zinazotokana na matumizi yako ya Huduma.">We work to keep the Service reliable. Counter sales continue when your connection drops and sync when it returns; table service, the kitchen screen and online orders need a working connection. We provide the Service “as is” without warranties of uninterrupted availability. To the maximum extent permitted by law, BiasharaPOS is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from your use of the Service.</p>

