  <p data-en="You may cancel your subscription or stop using the Service at any time. We may suspend or terminate access if these Terms are breached. On termination you can export your data subject to applicable legal retention periods." data-sw="Unaweza kusitisha usajili wako au kuacha kutumia Huduma wakati wowote. Tunaweza kusimamisha au kusitisha ufikiaji ikiwa Masharti haya yatakiukwa. Wakati wa kusitishwa unaweza kupakua data yako kwa kuzingatia vipindi vya uhifadhi vinavyohitajika kisheria.">You may cancel your subscription or stop using the Service at any time. We may suspend or terminate access if these Terms are breached. On termination you can export your data subject to applicable legal retention periods.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Changes &amp; governing law" data-sw="Mabadiliko na sheria inayotawala">Changes &amp; governing law</h2>
